      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果一直这样后倾的话……\r\n会变成“DEDU”的。也就是，“改变本质”呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94020ea04c21e4449b89133e1762db2e6527f0ce33fb68c8482a427b648e8ade",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
