    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7ff5c29e292aa0e0cdb91b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "怪不得最近她的成绩总是不太理想……！\r\n她说出『后倾』这个词后，我才恍然大悟。\r\n原来是重心太靠后了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60877a5b996f4d318e1b68f755f1708f6204614593276d88122278f7b8992496",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
