      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6afdd9b4f5082fa88cdb8be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但照理来说，这样的问题应该是本人更难注意到\r\n的……为什么身为训练员的我没能发现，\r\n反而是新宇宙自己便进行改正了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1293670103fcfdf405632aec5663bf1857aee69a539fbd2b5296adb837ce069",
